{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "跨端契约用例：Go 侧校验 gateway.Handle 的实际输出，Dart 侧校验同一份 Request/Response 信封的编解码。仅收录与阶段无关的稳定语义（schema 校验与已实现方法），避免出现 NOT_STARTED 等随装配进度变化的期望；未接入实现的方法用参数校验失败路径覆盖，保证 contract/api.json 中每个方法都至少有一条用例。",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "core.ping.ok",
      "request": {
        "id": 1,
        "method": "core.ping",
        "params": {}
      },
      "expect": {
        "ok": true
      },
      "response": {
        "ok": true,
        "data": {
          "pong": true,
          "server_ts": 1730000000000
        }
      },
      "data_required": [
        "pong",
        "server_ts"
      ],
      "data_types": {
        "pong": "bool",
        "server_ts": "int"
      }
    },
    {
